.\" -*- coding: UTF-8 -*-
.TH SEGLCDD.TOML 5 "2026-11-20" "seglcd" "File Formats"
.SH NAME
seglcdd.toml \- configuration file of seglcdd
.SH SYNOPSIS
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/seglcd/config.toml
(usually
.IR ~/.config/seglcd/config.toml ),
or
.I /etc/seglcd/config.toml
for the system service
.SH DESCRIPTION
The configuration of
.BR seglcdd (1)
in TOML 1.1 with snake_case keys. A missing file or a missing key means the default value.
Invalid values are reported in the journal and the defaults are used.
A fully commented file with all options and their defaults is installed from
.IR packaging/config.example.toml .
.SH TOP-LEVEL KEYS
.TP
.BR enabled " = " true
Feed the display. false sends the off packet and releases the device.
.TP
.BR update_interval_ms " = " 250
Packet interval in ms, 50\(en400. The display turns off after about 400\(en500 ms without a packet.
.TP
.BR sample_interval_ms " = " 1000
Sensor interval in ms, 100\(en10000. In between, the last values are repeated.
.TP
.BR device " = " \(dq\(dq
Device path such as /dev/hidraw5; empty means the first segment LCD found.
.SH [sensors]
Each key takes a sensor spec; an empty string selects the first available default.
.TP
.B cpu_temperature
Default: k10temp:Tctl, zenpower:Tdie, zenpower:Tctl, coretemp:Package id 0.
.TP
.B cpu_power
Default: rapl, zenpower:SVI2_P_Core+zenpower:SVI2_P_SoC.
.TP
.B cpu_voltage
Default: zenpower:SVI2_Core.
.TP
.BR cpu_clock_mode " = " \(dqavg\(dq
How the core clocks are combined: avg, max, min, first (core 0).
.TP
.B gpu_temperature
Default: amdgpu:edge, nvml:temperature, xe:pkg.
.TP
.B gpu_usage
Default: drm:busy, nvml:usage.
.TP
.B gpu_power
Default: amdgpu:PPT, nvml:power, rapl:uncore.
.TP
.B gpu_clock
Default: amdgpu:sclk, nvml:clock, drm:freq.
.TP
.BR fan ", " pump
Fan and pump speed; no default (the mainboard header depends on the system).
.SH SENSOR SPECS
.TP
.I chip:label
hwmon sensor, e.g. k10temp:Tctl (stable, preferred).
.TP
.I hwmonN/name
hwmon path, e.g. hwmon5/fan1 (the number may change).
.TP
.I a+b
Sum of several sensors.
.TP
.BR rapl [ :\fIdomain\fR ]
RAPL power: package (default), core, uncore, dram, psys.
.TP
.BR nvml [ \fIN\fR ] :\fImetric\fR
NVIDIA GPU: temperature, power, clock, memclock, usage, fan.
.TP
.BR drm [ \fIN\fR ] :\fImetric\fR
DRM card: busy, freq.
.PP
.B seglcd sensors
lists all sources available on the system together with their specs.
.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
update_interval_ms = 250
sample_interval_ms = 1000

[sensors]
cpu_temperature = "k10temp:Tctl"
cpu_power = "rapl"
fan = "it8686_31050607:fan1"
pump = "it8686_31050607:fan5"
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR seglcdd (1),
.BR seglcd (1)
